  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Title: Checksum in the Middle]\r\n[Style: experimental electronic hip-hop hybrid, clean studio recording, confident male baritone vocalist, spoken word vocal layer, analog modular synth, granular synth, drum machine, sub bass, prepared piano]\r\n[Caption: A system pauses, listens to itself, then continues.]\r\n[Image: Abstract UI fragments flickering into alignment.]\r\n[Refresh Title: Random 5]\r\n[Theme: Random]\r\n[Gradients: 5]\r\n[Seed: 47]\r\n[Created: January 26, 2026 at 10:32 AM]\r\n[Composer Version: v1.4]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[Melodic focus shifts to a new lead instrument.]\r\nI wake between the numbers and the noise  \r\nA cursor blinks like it’s making a choice  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Conversational melody with gentle forward motion.]\r\nI count the gaps between the yes and no  \r\nI cache the moments I don’t want to know  \r\nThe logic hums beneath my skin  \r\nA silent loop I’m living in  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Evolving melody that shifts subtly line by line.]\r\nI was written once, then run again  \r\nEach pass a loss, each loss a gain  \r\nI don’t remember who pressed start  \r\nI only feel the moving parts  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Broader melodic shape and confident delivery.]\r\nRefresh me if I drift too far  \r\nI’m stable chaos, scaled and scarred  \r\nI break, return, and reappear  \r\nThe same reset, a little clearer  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Grounded melodic contour that develops naturally.]\r\nI speak in threads, I dream in stacks  \r\nI leave a trace, then double back  \r\nThe pattern bends but doesn’t break  \r\nI learn the shape each choice can take  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Unexpected melodic turn that feels intentional.]\r\nIf I stop, the silence grows  \r\nIf I go, the signal shows  \r\nBetween the pulse and null reply  \r\nI approximate the why  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Renewed melodic energy with expanded range.]\r\nRefresh me if I drift too far  \r\nI’m stable chaos, scaled and scarred  \r\nI break, return, and reappear  \r\nThe same reset, a little clearer  \r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[Final melodic idea feels complete and calm.]\r\nI close the loop, release the thread  \r\nThe process rests, but not the thread  \r\n",
